      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The system prompts the person to opt in to Automatic Sign-In when the app calls [`requestAutoSignInAuthorization()`](vsuseraccountmanager/requestautosigninauthorization().md).",
      "normalizedSource": "The system prompts the person to opt in to Automatic Sign-In when the app calls [`requestAutoSignInAuthorization()`](vsuseraccountmanager/requestautosigninauthorization().md).",
