      "source": "If the person dismisses the prompt without approving, the system leaves the authorization status [`VSUserAccountManager.AutoSignInAuthorization.notDetermined`](vsuseraccountmanager/autosigninauthorization/notdetermined.md) and the framework doesn’t prompt them again until the app calls [`requestAutoSignInAuthorization()`](vsuseraccountmanager/requestautosigninauthorization().md) once more.",
      "normalizedSource": "If the person dismisses the prompt without approving, the system leaves the authorization status [`VSUserAccountManager.AutoSignInAuthorization.notDetermined`](vsuseraccountmanager/autosigninauthorization/notdetermined.md) and the framework doesn’t prompt them again until the app calls [`requestAutoSignInAuthorization()`](vsuseraccountmanager/requestautosigninauthorization().md) once more.",
      "sourceHash": "48c753d10633a3a5b84f4ef48b2141efc78b37e1929f23ed05c3123656e7eaab",
